Z||000000||Jim Jimenez||11-12-2001||01:57 AM||||I really hate the 3.33 final drive ratio used in the TH 125 transaxle in my Formula.<BR>Has anybody changed the gearing to the more sensible 2.84? Happy with the results?<P>||||reg||1
Z||000001||Jefrysuko||11-12-2001||02:52 AM||||What do you want to do?  Cruise at 90?  You would loose alot of bottom end power by going to that tall of a final drive.  What would be more sensible than trying to change gear ratios would be to swap in a 4-spd auto.  How does 65 mph at ~2200 rpm sound?||||reg||1
Z||000002||Old Lar||11-12-2001||12:01 PM||||Swap in a t440 and you can cruise at 80 and 2000 rpm.||||reg||1
