Z||000004||Old Lar||11-12-2001||08:40 PM||||T440s came from early 90s GM cars with 3800 engine. i.e. Bonneville, Buick Regals ||||reg||1
Z||000005||pherder||11-12-2001||10:52 PM||||And the 89 Grand Prix with a 2.8 (where I got mine from.)<P>440T4/440-T4 or 4T60 is the same transaxle and it is listed with several GM mid size cars.<P>Here are the axles that will work in the Fiero and the cars that they come from:<P>5257	1984-89	BUICK CENTURY	4 SPD. A/T W/ .785" DIA. THREADS	DRIVER<BR>5257	1984-89	CHEV. CELEBRITY	4 SPD. A/T W/ .785" DIA. THREADS	DRIVER<BR>5257	1984-89	OLDS CIERA	4 SPD. A/T W/.785" DIA. SPINDLE       	DRIVER<BR>5257	1984-89	PONTIAC 6000	4 SPD. A/T W/.785" DIA. THREADS      	DRIVER<BR>5258	1984-89	BUICK CENTURY	4 SPD. A/T W/ .785" DIA. THREADS	PASS<BR>5258	1984-89	CHEV. CELEBRITY	4 SPD. A/T W/ .785" DIA. THREADS	PASS<BR>5258	1984-89	OLDS CIERA	4 SPD. A/T W/.785" DIA. SPINDLE       	PASS<BR>5258	1984-89	PONTIAC 6000	4 SPD. A/T W/.785" DIA. THREADS      	PASS<P><A HREF="http://www.cvunlimited.com/Catalog2.htm" TARGET=_blank>CV Unlimited</A><P>Paul<p>[This message has been edited by pherder (edited 11-12-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000006||Jim Jimenez||11-13-2001||12:51 AM||||I just want to keep the car at least stock appearing. Let's do the math. a 225/60=15 tire makes about 808 revs per mile. So X 3.33 the engine turns 2690 rpm @60 mph. 3362 @ 75 mph.(25% more) this is very close to what the tach reads. whereas with 2.84's you would turn 2295 rpm @ 60 mph, and 2868 @ 75mph<BR>Late 80's and early 90's Grand Am GT's that still use a 125 trans use 2.84's, as well as a lot of other cars, and besides, stock Fieros don't do burnouts or run 12 sec quarter miles!<BR>Since I only drive the Fiero 3000 miles a year or so, maybe I'll just live with it, or install  5 speed!<P>||||reg||1
Z||000007||RedHaze86SD4||11-13-2001||07:41 AM||||The th125 in the 87 and 88 2m4's have a 2.84 final gear ratio. Thats if you want to keep your fiero stocker.<P>------------------<BR>The Possabilities are only hindered by your imagination and will to make them come alive....<P>-=Red Haze.. Its coming=-||||reg||1
